DESCRIPTION:Fairs & festivals + Concerts\nhttps://www.tjpa.org/salesforce-
 transit-center/activities\n\nThis December \, Salesforce Park is bringing
  back one of its popular winter events\, Winterfest. The three-day weeken
 d festival is a festive celebration\, taking place on December 4 through 
 6\, 2026. The free festival is in its 7th year and will feature a variety
  of activities. Attendees can expect swing dancing\, movies\, crafts\, an
 d a wreath-making party. More details are still coming for the festival
